# Explicitly uncalibrated queue-formation stress case.
# The geometry, release cadence, and 25/s gate rate are structural assumptions,
# not a station layout, demand profile, capacity estimate, or safety scenario.
scenario "queue-grid-formation-stress"
seed 73
duration 150s
timestep 100ms

surface concourse at (0m, 0m, 0m) size (40m, 16m)
exit street on concourse at (40m, 8m, 0m) width 3m
gate fare_gate on concourse at (32m, 8m, 0m) width 2m capacity 25/s to street
queue-grid fare_gate_queue gate fare_gate on concourse from (29m, 11m, 0m) to (2m, 11m, 0m) width 3.6m lanes 4 slots 152
agents passengers count 152 on concourse at (1m, 1m, 0m) to street speed 1.2m/s radius 0.3m height 1.7m release 0s every 4s batch 8
